{"title": "Listeners and Agents", "source": "adaptix", "source_label": "Adaptix C2", "path": "adaptix-c2/listeners-and-agents", "html": "<blockquote>\n<p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://adaptix-framework.gitbook.io/adaptix-framework/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to page URLs; this page is available as <a href=\"https://adaptix-framework.gitbook.io/adaptix-framework/adaptix-c2/listeners-and-agents.md\">Markdown</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h1 id=\"listeners-and-agents\">Listeners and Agents</h1>\n<p>Listeners are managed through the context menu of the listener tables.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-4403eb698ab66d82146b4dbbcddd4f507eaa067f%2FScreenshot_20250828_113711.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>The parameters in the dialog boxes for the listener and agents are created dynamically, depending on the corresponding Extender.</p>\n<figure><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-27a40679a71431ce24e5bd332c73e848a829dd7d%2FScreenshot_20251229_210045.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-04f6a8cb4f76b91f87f14a632a7376551fa6c8fc%2FScreenshot_20251229_210235.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\"><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<table data-header-hidden><thead><tr><th width=\"161\" align=\"center\"></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-7a36a244a7ee2bbf175531377f7b69bdb4ccba1b%2FScreenshot_20250727_225007.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Load the configuration from a JSON file</td></tr><tr><td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://2104178602-files.gitbook.io/~/files/v0/b/gitbook-x-prod.appspot.com/o/spaces%2FS8p8XLFtLmf0NkofQvoa%2Fuploads%2Fgit-blob-88a26440c438e4d4566984822aee828ab3203125%2FScreenshot_20250727_225015.png?alt=media\" alt=\"\"></td><td>Save the current configuration specified in the form to a JSON file</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<h2 id=\"default-listeners-and-agents\">Default Listeners and agents</h2>", "excerpt": "For the complete documentation index, see llms.txt . Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending .md to page URLs; this page is available as Markdown . Listeners and Agents Lis", "tags": []}